# @codebase
#
# `.secrets` has NO filter: it stays encrypted in the worktree too, and is opened in memory with sops
# when needed. A decrypted copy on disk is what a working-tree evaluation copies into the store.
# `diff` decides what a HUMAN reads: the sops-yaml diff driver's textconv renders each blob
# decrypted, so `git diff` shows the change instead of two walls of unrelated base64.
.secrets diff=sops-yaml
